# Purpose: Re-verify the 24 F-D OPEN cells (1531677 + 1420710 + 1189261 at
# d>=3) against current main HEAD, after the recent perf chunks that may
# have shifted what's optimal at d=5/d=6 on photo content:
#   - W44-29 (178c28793a3b) content-aware high_d_photo_hint for DCT32 entropy_mul
#   - W44-35 (4f8579e7d605) smart-dispatch try_dct64 for smooth photos at mid-d
#   - W44-43 (19f67008a52f) ANSHistogramStrategy::Approximate at VarDCT e<=7
#
# Result: ZERO byte/butteraugli/SSIM2 movement on any of the 24 cells.
# All cells re-bench byte-for-byte and metric-for-metric IDENTICAL to W44-45.
#
# Why "no movement": W44-29, W44-35, W44-43 all landed before the W44-45
# refresh (W44-45 was the re-bench post-W44-43). This chunk is a duplicate
# re-run against the same content-tree as W44-45 plus W44-44 (build-fix-only
# rename of W44-43) and W44-46 (investigate-only docs). The bench therefore
# proves the determinism — but does NOT add new information beyond W44-45.
#
