#   F-D cells are high-d photos where ANS overhead is a smaller fraction.)
# - W44-29 + W44-35 (DCT64/DCT32 content-aware dispatch) shifted dispatch
#   but not enough on F-D cells. From W44-45 attribution: AC GROUPS still
